        "https://developers.cloudflare.com/fundamentals/api/get-started/create-token/",
        "https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/user/subresources/tokens/methods/verify/"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "Credential-only healthcheck maps to official GET /user/tokens/verify used by the pinned User API Token validator, a cheap authenticated token read rather than listing destination addresses.",
        "Native sends Authorization Bearer only. Global API Key X-Auth-Email/X-Auth-Key dual headers and cfat_ Account API Tokens are omitted; Email Routing rejects account tokens per pinned source.",
        "HTTP 200 envelopes with a populated errors array are demoted via bodyErrorPaths [errors]. success is not used because true would false-fail.",
        "Native category is messaging (source Communication/Developer Tools; Communication is not in Rust CATEGORIES). Returns raw Cloudflare JSON under data. Upstream user-agent is not sent."
      ]
    },
    "addresses.list": {
      "upstreamActionId": "list_destination_addresses",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "action-list-addresses",
        "handler-list-addresses",
        "request-envelope"
      ],
      "documentationUrls": [
        "https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/email_routing/subresources/addresses/methods/list/"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "accountId is a required path segment on GET /accounts/{accountId}/email/routing/addresses. Optional page, perPage, direction, and verified bind to documented query names page, per_page, direction, verified.",
        "Returns raw Cloudflare JSON under data rather than the pinned {addresses, resultInfo} reshape."
      ]
    },
    "rules.list": {
      "upstreamActionId": "list_routing_rules",
      "sourceRefs": [
        "action-list-rules",
        "handler-list-rules",
        "request-envelope"
      ],
      "documentationUrls": [
        "https://developers.cloudflare.com/api/resources/email_routing/subresources/rules/methods/list/"
      ],
      "responseContract": "appcall-provider-json-v1",
      "adaptations": [
        "zoneId is a required path segment on GET /zones/{zoneId}/email/routing/rules. Account-scoped GET /accounts/{accountId}/email/routing/rules is omitted so one list path remains; pinned source treats zoneId and accountId as mutually exclusive.",
        "Optional enabled, page, and perPage bind to documented query names. Returns raw Cloudflare JSON under data rather than {rules, resultInfo}. Writes (create/update/delete rule) are omitted."
      ]
    }
